[
  {"text":"그 정중앙이\n고릴라 게임\n투자자야", "cx":105, "cy":758, "w":175, "size":22, "font":"B", "color":"#1a1a1a"},
  {"text":"제가… 그 자리에\n있다고요?", "cx":105, "cy":1288, "w":150, "size":18, "font":"B", "color":"#1a1a1a"},
  {"text":"오! 그럼 저도\n고릴라 투자자?", "cx":317, "cy":1262, "w":170, "size":18, "font":"B", "color":"#1a1a1a"},
  {"text":"넌 '배울 자세'\n부터", "cx":680, "cy":1273, "w":155, "size":18, "font":"B", "color":"#1a1a1a"}
]
